岗位职责：
1.	Responsible for components development strategy making, benchmark analysis, system and vehicle performance target setup and layout of components; 
2.	Responsible for technical document of SOR,DVP,DFMEA,3D/2D data release work;
3.	Achieve components/system/vehicle level performance target, track and control risk; 
4.	Cooperate with partners for restraints components development to achieve target.
5.	Ensure the high quality in all the program delivery activities and in time 
6.	Work with cross function (Design,Pur,PQM,ME,EQ ect) to resolve complex issues.
7.	Drive design and performance improvement, drive cost and mass reduction.

任职要求：
1.	Bachelor's degree or above in Automotive/Mechanical/Materials Engineering related;
2.	Minimum 5 years of design & development experience of Restraints components at OEMs or Suppliers and familiar with domestic and foreign regulations;
3.	Understanding of Restraints components structure principle and production process;
4.	Proficiency in English, oral and written;
5.	Skilled in CATIA and MS office software. Familiar with CAE related software； 
6.	Good communication skill and teamwork;
7.	Willing to business trips;

岗位职责：
Job Responsibilities
1. formulate and implement market management strategy for parts in national warehouse, establish parts library, optimize the strategy regularly based on market dynamics, sales data and customer feedback, and ensure rational allocation and efficient use of spare parts resources in national warehouse;
2. Inventory control and regulation: establish a sound inventory monitoring system for spare parts in the national warehouse, track the inventory level in real time, and set the safety inventory threshold in collaboration with relevant departments to avoid inventory backlog or out-of-stock situation, and ensure the timeliness and stability of spare parts supply;
3. market insight and sales promotion: in-depth analysis of the national library parts market demand, in-depth study of industry trends, competitors' strategies and changes in customer demand, and regularly write market analysis reports to provide a strong basis for the company to develop accurate sales strategy;
4. Logistics coordination and optimization: establish a sound logistics information tracking mechanism, monitor the status of parts transportation in real time, and for delays, damages and other abnormalities in the transportation process, quickly coordinate the resources of all parties to take effective countermeasures to ensure that the customer's parts delivery experience;
5. Team management and collaboration: lead and manage the parts sales team, clarify the work responsibilities and goals of team members, and build an efficient and professional sales team.

任职要求：
Job Requirements
1. more than 5 years of experience in OEM parts warehousing, logistics, etc., understanding of the overall business process, including the parts warehouse 0 to 1 setup, new energy and high-end brand experience can be prioritized;
2. good English and office skills;
3. accept short-term overseas business trips, such as China;
4. strong sense of responsibility, with customer-centric awareness;
5. good communication and good team management skills.

岗位职责：
Job Responsibilities:
1. Responsible for the development and management of major clients in the UK market, including corporate clients, government projects, leasing companies, and fleet clients;
2. Establish and maintain long-term client relationships, deeply understand client needs, and provide customized new energy vehicle solutions;
3. Develop and implement major client sales strategies to achieve annual and quarterly sales targets;
Participate in sales pricing strategy development, responsible for major client quotations, contract negotiations, and project implementation;
4. Collaborate with the marketing department to conduct brand promotion and client activities (product launches, test drives, corporate roadshows, etc.);
5. Manage the regional dealer's major client sales collaboration mechanism to enhance dealer's B2B capabilities;
6. Follow up on the overall coordination of order delivery, financing solutions, and after-sales service to improve customer satisfaction;
7. Output sales data analysis and market insights to provide decision-making support for management.

任职要求：
Job Requirements:
1. Bachelor's degree or above, preferably in Marketing, Business Administration, Engineering, or a related field;
2. Minimum 7 years of experience in B2B sales, key account management, and key account sales management in the automotive industry;
3. Familiarity with the UK automotive market, with priority given to candidates possessing resources in corporate clients, fleet clients, or government projects;
4. Excellent business negotiation and project management skills;
5. Ability to adapt to frequent business trips and a fast-paced work environment;
6. Good English communication skills;
7. Proficient in using office software such as CRM, Excel, and PowerPoint.

岗位职责：
1、依据会计准则对应付、关联公司间业务交易进行账务核算，确保及时性、准确性和完整性，满足内外部遵从的要求;
2、分析检查应付核算流程相关的成本、费用以及应付预付类的账务务数据的合理性，识别风险和差错，优化完善制度流程和核算方案;
3、负责应付核算流程相关报表制定和月度结账工作，并在结账期对应付核算流程相关的重点科目的变动进行分析，确保应讨流程相关的账务核算的准确性;
4、对负责的应付核算类的新业务场景给出核算方案建议，协同司前后端模块制定落地方案并督促执行，最终落地到应付核算的的流程和IT方案中;
5、负责应付核算流程相关的资产负债科目的(如应付账款、预付账张款等)对账分析，并定期对长账龄数据进行监控与清理，确保财务报告的数据质量。

任职要求：
1、会计、财务管理等相关专业，本科及以上学历;
2、3年以上大中型企业账务核算工作经验，有应付类、关联交易核算工作经验者优先;
3、具有良好的沟通技巧和团队合作精神，推动力强且能承担较大工作压动;
4、熟练操作办公软件，SAP经验优先;
5、英语四级及以上，具备良好读写能力。

岗位职责：
1、主导并能及时完成自动化项目的仿真、动画制作，包括需求沟通、方案理解、仿真制作、数据分析、动画展示等;
2. 完成产线生产状态的模拟验证，输出产线产能、瓶颈分析、设备利用率等相关仿真结果报告，提供工艺可行性方案及建议;
3、完成机器人选型、连接设备选型和模拟，为新工厂、新/改造产线的建设输出仿真报告和改进建议。
4、与机械设计工程师交流，对非标设备设计提供建议，夹具或非标设备干涉检查并反馈修改建议；

任职要求：
1. 本科及以上学历，工业工程、物流及相关专业，5年及以上仿真工作经验;
2. 能熟练使用仿真软件，完成工厂及产线3D仿真;
3. 熟悉智能工厂，能够接受新知识，具有快速学习能力，抗压力强；
4. 有编程能力，能够进行二次开发，了解生产制造、仓储物流相关流程，熟悉物流与生产调度者优先考虑；
